intent: Land N=35 git_fleet rep-2 corpus-v3 run record: 20/60 accepted, wall 126s, cost $6.78. 22 failures are merge conflicts on contended clusters; 18 additional failures (t1-9, t14-15, t17-18, t30, t32, t38, t49-50) are cascading failures from a final build_ok=False -- the merged main branch does not compile, so acceptance tests fail regardless of whether their own ticket landed cleanly. Replicates scale-up 1's bimodal git failure mode (contention-only losses vs near-total build-poisoning loss) at N=35/corpus v3, and rep 1's smaller smoke_ok=False event looks like the same underlying failure mode at lower severity.
